 Africa","inception":-2179,"dissolved":350,"enwiki":"Kingdom of Kush","summary":"The Kingdom of Kush, also known as the Kushite Empire, or simply Kush, was an ancient kingdom in Nubia, centered along the Nile Valley in what is now northern Sudan and southern Egypt.\nThe region of Nubia was an early cradle of civilization, producing several complex societies that engaged in trade and industry. The city-state of Kerma emerged as the dominant political force between 2450 and 1450 BC, controlling the Nile Valley between the first and fourth cataracts, an area as large as Egypt. The Egyptians were the first to identify Kerma as \"Kush\" probably from the indigenous ethnonym \"Kasu\", and over the next several centuries the two civilizations engaged in intermittent warfare, trade, and cultural exchange."}],"facts":[{"qid":"Q241790","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q743282","value_label":"Napata","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Napata"},{"qid":"Q241790","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q5780","value_label":"Meroë","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Meroë"}],"people":{},"media":{},"names":["Cus","Cuscita","Cushitisch","Cuxe","Khusita","Kingdom of Kush","Koesj","Koninkrijk van Kush","Koninkrijk van Nubie","Koninkrijk van Nubië","Kouch","Kouchite","Koush","Kush","Kushiet","Kushita","Kushitas","Kushite Empire","Kushiti","Kusz","Kuş Krallığı","Regno di Kush","Regno di Meroe","Regno di Nubia","Reich von Kusch","Reino de Cuxe","Reino de Kush","Reino de Meroé","Royaume de Kouch","royaume de Koush","Äthiopien","Βασίλειο του Κους","Νουβία","Куш","Мероитское царство","الفراعنة السود","الكوشيون","الكوشيين","المملكة الكوشية","مملكة النوبة","مملكة كوش","پادشاهی کوش","कुश","クシュ","クシュ王国","古實","古實王國","库什","庫施","庫施王國"]}